  "measurement_scope": "Complete local candidate retrieval, hybrid rank fusion and final MMR/context selection. max_hops=0 isolates keyword-index construction and unchanged ranking; results do not measure or attribute improvements to graph traversal controls or provenance.",
  "implementation": "Index construction borrows already-lowercase ASCII words while counting per-chunk frequencies and performs borrowed vocabulary lookup, allocating a persistent key only on first insertion. Unicode and uppercase words retain the original complete str::to_lowercase transformation. Query tokenization, scoring arithmetic, cache generation, memory caps and query-only fallback are preserved.",
  "limitations": [
    "One synthetic in-memory English workload on one machine; not a general throughput, multilingual performance or RAG quality claim.",
    "Excludes fixture ingestion, invalidation writes, providers, network, HTTP handling and JSON result serialization.",
