    "The main agent paused builds/tests during timing, but the operating system was not isolated or pinned and background desktop activity was not controlled.",
    "Three paired processes with fixed cold-then-warm phase order per query; warm phases benefit from normal hot CPU/data caches.",
    "Wall-clock retrieval timings were measured, not allocator instrumentation or peak memory. Memory bounds are separately covered by focused correctness tests.",
    "Baseline and current include other retrieval-control changes, disabled here by max_hops=0; full canonical output equality was required across all six runs."
